{"k":"treq","t":"Trigonometric Equations","cls":"11","u":"Trigonometry","s":[["General solutions",[{"q":"General solution of $\\sin\\theta=\\sin\\alpha$","f":"\\theta=n\\pi+(-1)^n\\alpha,\\quad n\\in\\mathbb Z"},{"q":"General solution of $\\cos\\theta=\\cos\\alpha$","f":"\\theta=2n\\pi\\pm\\alpha"},{"q":"General solution of $\\tan\\theta=\\tan\\alpha$","f":"\\theta=n\\pi+\\alpha"},{"q":"Squared forms","f":"\\sin^2\\theta=\\sin^2\\alpha,\\ \\cos^2\\theta=\\cos^2\\alpha,\\ \\tan^2\\theta=\\tan^2\\alpha\\ \\Rightarrow\\ \\theta=n\\pi\\pm\\alpha"},{"q":"Zeros and special values","f":"\\sin\\theta=0\\Rightarrow\\theta=n\\pi;\\quad\\cos\\theta=0\\Rightarrow\\theta=(2n+1)\\tfrac\\pi2;\\quad\\tan\\theta=0\\Rightarrow\\theta=n\\pi","n":"$\\sin\\theta=1\\Rightarrow\\theta=2n\\pi+\\frac\\pi2$; $\\cos\\theta=1\\Rightarrow2n\\pi$; $\\cos\\theta=-1\\Rightarrow(2n+1)\\pi$."},{"q":"Simultaneous equations ($\\sin\\theta=\\sin\\alpha$, $\\cos\\theta=\\cos\\alpha$)","f":"\\theta=2n\\pi+\\alpha","n":"Find $\\alpha$ in $[0,2\\pi)$ satisfying both, then add $2n\\pi$."}]],["Standard forms",[{"q":"$a\\cos\\theta+b\\sin\\theta=c$","f":"\\cos(\\theta-\\phi)=\\frac c{\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}},\\ \\tan\\phi=\\frac ba;\\qquad\\text{solvable iff } |c|\\le\\sqrt{a^2+b^2}"},{"q":"Equations in $\\sin x\\pm\\cos x$ and $\\sin x\\cos x$","f":"t=\\sin x+\\cos x\\Rightarrow\\sin x\\cos x=\\frac{t^2-1}2,\\ \\ t\\in[-\\sqrt2,\\sqrt2]"},{"q":"Equations reducible by $\\tan\\frac\\theta2$","f":"\\sin\\theta=\\frac{2t}{1+t^2},\\quad\\cos\\theta=\\frac{1-t^2}{1+t^2},\\quad t=\\tan\\tfrac\\theta2","n":"Check $\\theta=(2n+1)\\pi$ separately (lost when substituting)."}]],["Common results",[{"q":"Things to check when solving","f":"\\text{domain},\\ \\text{extraneous roots from squaring},\\ \\text{division by a zero factor}"},{"q":"Number of solutions by graph","f":"\\#\\text{solutions of } f(x)=g(x)=\\#\\text{intersections of } y=f(x),\\ y=g(x)"},{"q":"Equations with boundedness","f":"\\sin^m x+\\cos^n x=1\\ \\text{or}\\ 